// AWS EBS Snapshot Deleted  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1490
// Detects deletion of EBS snapshots (DeleteSnapshot), removing volume recovery points.
// False positives: Snapshot lifecycle/retention cleanup.
// Source: rules/impact/ec2-delete-snapshot.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^DeleteSnapshot$/i eventSource=/^ec2\.amazonaws\.com$/i
